omment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":182887952,"discussion_id":"3d346276926bd62cbd24e4b9a491f3e6de699b2d","body":"\uD83D\uDFE1 **Medium Priority**\n\n本 diff 在 `Init` 中将 `blockIdx_ * block_factor * num_col` 提升为 64 位计算（第 39 行），修复了 GM 偏移溢出。但在同一文件的 `Process()` 中（第 85 行），`i_o` 已是 `uint64_t` 类型，而 `CopyOutY`（第 307 行）仍接受 `uint32_t i_o` 参数。调用 `CopyOutY(i_o)`（第 93 行）发生隐式收窄，且 `CopyOutY` 内部 `(i_o * row_factor) * num_col` 在 `uint32_t * uint32_t` 域完成乘法，溢出后才与 `uint64_t num_col` 相乘，属于\"假保护\"模式。\n\n同时 `CopyOutTailY`（第 258 行）接受 `uint32_t i_o_max`，但调用方传入 `uint64_t i_o_max`（第 102 行），存在相同的收窄问题。\n\n虽然当前 `row_work ≤ block_factor`（单 core 行数）实际不会超过 `UINT32_MAX`，但本 PR 的意图正是系统性地消除 int32 溢出隐患，此遗漏使整体系列修复不完整，且未来若 block_factor 增大则直接触发数据写入错误 GM 地址。\n\n**建议**：将 `CopyOutY` 和 `CopyOutTailY` 的 `i_o`/`i_o_max` 参数类型从 `uint32_t` 改为 `uint64_t`，与 `Process()` 中的调用方保持一致，确保 GM 偏移计算在全 64 位域完成。\n\n```suggestion\n    __aicore__ inline void CopyOutY(uint64_t i_o)\n```\n","created_at":"2026-08-03T11:29:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-13T15:33:16+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6822d8eae4b985165b4b0cf2","login":"liuyun_nj","object_id":"6822d8eae4b985165b4b0cf2","name":"liuyun_nj","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liuyun_nj"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":307,"end_new_line":307,"start_old_line":305,"end_old_line":305,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":182969177,"discussion_id":"0c1f85d5cad0570433d5128a90e534e48a07af31","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-08-03T17:42:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-03T17:42:10+08:00","user":{"id":"68b14ec355aaf21f7ae618e0","login":"Chen_HaoWen","object_id":"68b14ec355aaf21f7ae618e0","name":"Chen_HaoWen","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Chen_HaoWen"}