url":"https://gitcode.com/liujie12345678"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":182990481,"discussion_id":"4ece2d48c773e7a886b4be1fbf9586b186a4bc41","body":"The following users do not have permission to comment `/lgtm` or `/approve` on any module in this PR:\n[*陈昊文*](https://gitcode.com/Chen_HaoWen), [*刘杰*](https://gitcode.com/liujie12345678)","created_at":"2026-08-03T19:33:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-03T19:33:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":182990503,"discussion_id":"82b121d11e82c6cbc2fb48d9733a6598d24a09a8","body":"The following users do not have permission to comment `/lgtm` or `/approve` on any module in this PR:\n[*陈昊文*](https://gitcode.com/Chen_HaoWen), [*刘杰*](https://gitcode.com/liujie12345678)","created_at":"2026-08-03T19:33:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-03T19:33:44+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183864515,"discussion_id":"990a7f954665291b9a1092294ca782dba93bb526","body":"**[Suggestion] PR 描述和 issue 关联为空**\n\nPR body 所有部分均为空。修复 int32 溢出是 bugfix，应描述触发条件（如大 shape 下 blockIdx * block_factor * num_col 超过 INT32_MAX）和影响场景。","created_at":"2026-08-08T15:33:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-08T15:33:29+08:00","user":{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","object_id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183864517,"discussion_id":"d659b37f6bfe3c3088fcceebb1fcee12eb787afb","body":"**[Question] rms_norm_merge_n.h 中三重 static_cast 风格不一致**\n\n**文件**: `norm/rms_norm/op_kernel/rms_norm_merge_n.h`\n**行号**: L100\n\n```cpp\nuint64_t gmBias = static_cast<uint64_t>(i_o) * static_cast<uint64_t>(rowFactor) * static_cast<uint64_t>(numCol);\n```\n\n其他文件中使用单次 cast（如 `static_cast<uint64_t>(blockIdx_) * block_factor * num_col`），此处使用了三次 cast。由于 `i_o` 是 `uint32_t`，第一次 cast 后乘积自动提升为 `uint64_t`，后续 cast 多余。\n\n**建议**: 统一为 `static_cast<uint64_t>(i_o) * rowFactor * numCol`。","created_at":"2026-08-08T15:33:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-08T15:33:29+08:00","user":{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","object_id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184167859,"discussion_id":"37f03a1df8a4fec809293ab92a2e03b310ecf438","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-08-11T08:42:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-11T08:42:36+08:00","user":{"id":"68b14ec355aaf21f7ae618e0","login":"Chen_HaoWen","object_id":"68b14ec355aaf21f7ae618e0","name":"Chen_HaoWen","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Chen_HaoWen"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184167860,"discussion_id":"286ca3d0215b4262abfbae4f074d7269aca17bc3","body":"The following users do not have permission to comment `/lgtm` or `/approve` on any module in this PR:\n[*陈昊文*](https://gitcode.com/Chen_HaoWen)","created_at":"2026-08-11T08:42:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-11T08:42:41+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184603639,"discussion_id":"c54d79690e9d1e5f222fce648ee3d2f6be69b467","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-08-13T14:10:45+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-13T14:10:45+08:00",